        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Elsevier España, S.L. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Hip pain is a frequent cause of medical attention in the daily clinical practice. Among the different causes included in the differential diagnosis we find ischiofemoral impingement, described initially in patients after joint replacement surgery, but later found in patients with no history of a causal disease."
